ression GATE is deterministic-only; all LLM/cross-family judging is advisory and\n25\t  isolated from the (terminal) Foreman gate.\n26\t- North-Star anti-drift gate: non-goals are machine-checkable negative canaries; a revision advancing a\n27\t  non-goal is rejected.\n28\t- Persona = method + LOGICAL model tier (a swappable brain seam), so a different brain can be swapped in later.\n29\t- Machine-checkable handoff contract (north-star round-trip + existence-checked paths + block-on-open-questions).\n30\t- recreate-a-paper: required upstream lineage/lit-review + Assumptions Ledger + understandâ†’build firewall +\n31\t  executed numbers BOUND to the verified module + context-isolated advisory grader.\n32\t\n33\t## Out of scope (anti-drift)\n34\tGWL harness / t2rs brain (parallel track); stateful productivity/personal agents (later program phases); the\n35\textend-own-paper second slice; Jumper/doc-writing/legal/propose-extensions (later portfolio waves).\n36\t\n37\t## Provenance\n38\tForged by researchPrime (ENGINE-verified Phase-0 research) â†’ Crucible (Stage 0 lock â†’ Stage 1 Master Plan v4,\n39\t3 Shark-Tank rounds to convergence â†’ Stage 2). See `crucible/MASTER-PLAN.md`, `CRUCIBLE-INTAKE.md`,\n40\t`research/phase0-run/DELIVERABLE.md`.\n41\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3d7473a0-dc0d-43df-977e-aa113230edf6","uuid":"e2d675cb-0ccf-45e3-814f-09066f09fb14","timestamp":"2026-06-23T00:49:14.101Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"C:/dev/Skill Foundry/planning/portfolio-program/DESCRIPTION.md","content":"# Portfolio Program â€” Description (frozen design / North Star)\n\n## North Star (LOCKED)\nBuild a deep, self-improving skill repository in Skill Foundry â€” model-agnostic cognitive skills,\ncompositional recipes, and (later) stateful agents â€” where every skill carries a LOCKED North Star, journals\nits own real-use experience, and is improved during \"sleep\" sessions WITHOUT drifting from its designed\npurpose. First end-to-end