isolated advisory grader.\n\n## Out of scope (anti-drift)\nGWL harness / t2rs brain (parallel track); stateful productivity/personal agents (later program phases); the\nextend-own-paper second slice; Jumper/doc-writing/legal/propose-extensions (later portfolio waves).\n\n## Provenance\nForged by researchPrime (ENGINE-verified Phase-0 research) â†’ Crucible (Stage 0 lock â†’ Stage 1 Master Plan v4,\n3 Shark-Tank rounds to convergence â†’ Stage 2). See `crucible/MASTER-PLAN.md`, `CRUCIBLE-INTAKE.md`,\n`research/phase0-run/DELIVERABLE.md`.\n","numLines":41,"startLine":1,"totalLines":41}}}
